title: Wave A — media-bin backend + bottom timeline UI + studio shell rework
summary: Three parallel Kits landed Wave A of the v1.0 media-bin pivot + bottom timeline bundle. Kit-A collapsed the no-target ingest dispatcher to just add-to-bin, added transcribeMediaToBin standalone entrypoint, added ?source=existing endpoint for sidebar→canvas drag, and rewrote /api/media/ingest's no-target branch to stash files in media/ without auto-creating a doc. Kit-B added a read-only bottom timeline component (TimelineView) — single track lane, clip blocks proportional to startFrame/endFrame, frame ruler with playhead, click-to-select, click-ruler-to-seek. Kit-C reworked the studio UI shell — drop-zone sidebar label changed to "Add to media", DOCS empty-state hint extends when MEDIA populated, toast-on-first-drop for bin-add feedback, and a flex-column layout with canvasMount (1fr) + timelineMount (120px) split. Workspace tests 1188→1189, all green.
